---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site';
---
<Base title="About" description={SITE.tagline}>
  <h1>About</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>I build systems. Some run on code, some run on hardware, and most end up a mix of both.</p>
    <p>
      My work sits in applied AI: routing requests to the right model, giving a fleet of agents shared
      memory, voice and image pipelines, and the evaluation work that says whether any of it is good.
      I run my own infrastructure, from a Jetson Orin Nano at the edge to GPU render servers, and I like
      to measure what I build before I claim anything about it.
    </p>
    <p>
      I work across Python, TypeScript and Java, and C for hardware. Outside of that: guitar, sound design,
      and building things that don't fit neatly into categories.
    </p>
    <p>Based in {SITE.location}.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
